/** metres of the world one tile of the grime picture covers */
const GRIME_TILE = 3;

/**
 * Grime, as one picture that multiplies the paint, laid by UVs in metres (one tile every GRIME_TILE m): rain streaks
 * running down from every edge (fine across, long along), blotches of road film and faded patches. v runs up.
