/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ materials ------------------------------- */

/**
 * The materials of a heavy vehicle, few so that a crowd of them is a few draw calls: one `body` for everything
 * opaque (paint, chassis, plastics, steel, rubber, lenses, wheels, a load), each part's colour baked into its vertex
